{"4594740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Still Breathing", "steam_appid": 4594740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/1fa6d52ac6b6e1825ec124e751fe2263.poster.avif?t=1785021248\" width=966 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/1fa6d52ac6b6e1825ec124e751fe2263.webm?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/1fa6d52ac6b6e1825ec124e751fe2263.mp4?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/b29b4eeaf016e0c3aa03bfdcee14facf.poster.avif?t=1785021248\" width=966 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/b29b4eeaf016e0c3aa03bfdcee14facf.webm?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/b29b4eeaf016e0c3aa03bfdcee14facf.mp4?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEEP YOUR FAMILY ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has collapsed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you live locked away in an <strong>old underground bunker</strong>, surviving day by day amid dampness, clanging noises, and lights that fail all too often. Your family depends entirely on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage scarce resources—food, water, medicine, fuel, and electricity—while you try to keep the shelter operational. Craft tools, weapons, and essential supplies. Repair the facilities. Upgrade the bunker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you’d better keep it running, <strong>because if the bunker falls, your family falls with it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/6968bfd41740054d593ce565c432b6f1.poster.avif?t=1785021248\" width=974 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/6968bfd41740054d593ce565c432b6f1.webm?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/6968bfd41740054d593ce565c432b6f1.mp4?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/2d47c33522a5c35fda54689869c5fa12.webp?t=1785021248\" width=847 height=56 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival isn't just about stockpiling resources.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 60 narrative events can change the course of the game from one day to the next. Illnesses, breakdowns, family conflicts, accidents, unexpected visitors, or desperate situations will constantly put your decisions to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll never know what awaits you when you wake up.<strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/02e6370c29ce92cc445a45f6c7096172.poster.avif?t=1785021248\" width=974 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/02e6370c29ce92cc445a45f6c7096172.webm?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/02e6370c29ce92cc445a45f6c7096172.mp4?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/39ce441e0e918adc2a879f0631a56a54.webp?t=1785021248\" width=847 height=56 /></span><strong>The surface is still up there.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empty. Damp. Unrecognizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send expeditions to more than fifteen unique locations: abandoned homes, hospitals, schools, supermarkets, police stations, and other forgotten ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for supplies. Uncover secrets. Find survivors… Or what’s left of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful. Anyone who spends too much time out there starts to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/dffa6b475699a7f23be1cfba7393de60.poster.avif?t=1785021248\" width=974 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/dffa6b475699a7f23be1cfba7393de60.webm?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/dffa6b475699a7f23be1cfba7393de60.mp4?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/8168342d4c314c90eb2e10a40fb27c34.webp?t=1785021248\" width=847 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every family member has their own fears, thoughts, and opinions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 dynamic conversations react to your decisions, illnesses, losses, and the constant pressure of survival. Trust can be broken. Resentment can grow. Some arguments never really end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your family changes with you—and sometimes because of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/84c5d150b6d151a0b6f316aac9f9826d.poster.avif?t=1785021248\" width=974 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/84c5d150b6d151a0b6f316aac9f9826d.webm?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/84c5d150b6d151a0b6f316aac9f9826d.mp4?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/4b6716c7337febb35ec0779422bff558.webp?t=1785021248\" width=847 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't the only ones still alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, strangers may appear, seeking help, shelter… or something worse. A lost child. An injured woman. A nervous soldier. You might encounter anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their stories unfold over several days and evolve based on your decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping someone could save you weeks later… or doom you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/1df4836c5045a1a4ea9ae35fea969718.poster.avif?t=1785021248\" width=974 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/1df4836c5045a1a4ea9ae35fea969718.webm?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/1df4836c5045a1a4ea9ae35fea969718.mp4?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/904a169dbfae1f20bb2d64deb73799de.webp?t=1785021248\" width=847 height=56 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploring the outdoors means taking risks.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against looters, desperate survivors, and mutated creatures in a turn-based combat system where stress, exhaustion, and physical condition directly affect each character’s performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons and gear to increase your chances of survival. Bring your dog along on expeditions and decide what kind of person you’re willing to become to keep going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/1f40d45173cb679da31b8beab27b4d2d.poster.avif?t=1785021248\" width=974 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/1f40d45173cb679da31b8beab27b4d2d.webm?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/1f40d45173cb679da31b8beab27b4d2d.mp4?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/2008aec65f36a8719d55afd2d7b46a31.webp?t=1785021248\" width=847 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows what happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore forgotten terminals, extract information from people, crack passwords, and access classified documents to piece together the events that led to the world’s collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far will you go to uncover the truth… and what ending awaits you when you do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/0cac8f7c366839ba106371260d47f557.poster.avif?t=1785021248\" width=974 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/0cac8f7c366839ba106371260d47f557.webm?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/0cac8f7c366839ba106371260d47f557.mp4?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage food, water, medicine, fuel, and electricity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools, weapons, and upgrades to keep the bunker running.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁠⁠Over 60 narrative events that can change the course of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁠Explore over 15 unique locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁠Over 300 dynamic conversations with your family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁠Multi-branching stories involving nighttime visitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁠Turn-based tactical combat where stress and exhaustion affect every fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁠Explore the surface with your faithful dog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁠Investigate terminals, emails, and secret files.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁠Permanent consequences for your family members.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⁠Over 15 different endings based on your decisions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From Dad and Son Games. Made by a father and son who wanted to build a game about family that doesn't pull any punches.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/1fa6d52ac6b6e1825ec124e751fe2263.poster.avif?t=1785021248\" width=966 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/1fa6d52ac6b6e1825ec124e751fe2263.webm?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/1fa6d52ac6b6e1825ec124e751fe2263.mp4?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/b29b4eeaf016e0c3aa03bfdcee14facf.poster.avif?t=1785021248\" width=966 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/b29b4eeaf016e0c3aa03bfdcee14facf.webm?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/b29b4eeaf016e0c3aa03bfdcee14facf.mp4?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEEP YOUR FAMILY ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has collapsed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you live locked away in an <strong>old underground bunker</strong>, surviving day by day amid dampness, clanging noises, and lights that fail all too often. Your family depends entirely on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage scarce resources—food, water, medicine, fuel, and electricity—while you try to keep the shelter operational. Craft tools, weapons, and essential supplies. Repair the facilities. Upgrade the bunker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you’d better keep it running, <strong>because if the bunker falls, your family falls with it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/6968bfd41740054d593ce565c432b6f1.poster.avif?t=1785021248\" width=974 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/6968bfd41740054d593ce565c432b6f1.webm?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/6968bfd41740054d593ce565c432b6f1.mp4?t=1785021248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4594740/extras/2d47c33522a5c35fda54689869c5fa12.webp?t=1785021248\" width=847 height=56 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival isn't just about stockpiling resources.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 60 narrative events can change the course of the game from one day to the next. Illnesses, breakdowns, family conflicts, accidents, unexpected visitors, or desperate situations will constantly put your decisions to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll never know what awaits you when you wake up.<strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span